    LLM: '1. Stage 1: Claim pools for pay-suit cards. 2. Stage 2: Bet (Pochen); best pair/triple/quartet wins. 3. Stage 3: Winner of Pochen (or left of dealer if all pass) leads; play next higher in suit; stop when no one has next card; last player leads again. First out wins.',
